msgstr ""

msgid ""
"How long a list is left alone before it may be retired, counted both "
"from when it stopped accepting credentials and from when the last "
"credential in it expired, and once more before its entries are "
"removed. Retiring makes a URI written into real credentials answer "
"404, so this is the margin for anything still working from a cached "
"response, and for an issuance which was under way when the list "
"closed. Runs from the cron hook."
msgstr ""

